&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 549px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 0px none "&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;MUJI EUROPE HOLDINGS LIMITEDが株式取得によりMUJI SPAIN, S.L.およびMUJI PORTUGAL, LDAを子会社化。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
&lt;tr style="height: 20px"&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 100px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="text-align: center"&gt;2016年２月&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;td style="vertical-align: top; width: 549px; padding-top: 0px; padding-bottom: 0px; padding-left: 0px; padding-right: 0px; border-left: 1px solid #000000; border-top: 0px none ; border-right: 1px solid #000000; border-bottom: 1px solid #000000"&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-left: 12px; margin-right: 6px; text-align: left"&gt;Ryohin‐Keikaku Reliance India Private Limitedを設立。&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;/td&gt;
&lt;/tr&gt;
